# Styling

## Key Patterns

- Always use `<style scoped lang="scss">`
- Use `:deep()` to override Quasar component styles
- Use CSS variables: `var(--b-text-main)`, `var(--b-text-sub)`
- Use Quasar utility classes for spacing: `q-pa-md`, `q-mb-lg`

## Canonical Examples

- **Quasar classes**: See Quasar docs for `row`, `col`, `flex`, spacing utilities
- **Design tokens**: See Figma Integration guide in Confluence (if mcp available)
